WEBVTT

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:13.720
Lailalo, do we have any new info on the Ryunka?!

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.530
Yes, I have updated data.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:19.230
Captain Megius sent it in.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:20.800
The Captain?

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:24.900
Evidently it's possible to
separate the Ryunka from its host.

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:26.000
How?

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.500
According to an ancient document
the pontiffs were able to decipher,

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:30.510
when it enters Vandeilo, its third phase,

00:00:30.510 --> 00:00:33.080
it contracts within the host.

00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:36.910
You should be able to transfer it
to another life form at that point.

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:41.220
After transfer, the Ryunka will
begin growing within its new host.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:44.250
If you end the host's biological
functions before it manifests,

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.860
you can secure the Ryunka.

00:00:46.860 --> 00:00:49.530
How long before it enters Vandeilo?

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.330
Most likely a little less than an hour.

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.560
Okay, I'll box in the Ryunka until then

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:57.560
and keep it from hurting any Earthlings!

00:01:15.850 --> 00:01:16.840
Okay.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:22.550
Shit!

00:01:32.140 --> 00:01:38.910
<i>Will the sky one day grow tired of</i>
<i>looking down and lose its blue color?</i>

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:47.910
<i>There's just one blue sky over this</i>
<i>world rife with countless emotions</i>

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:54.920
<i>The sound of the battle raging somewhere</i>

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.890
<i>And the laughter right nearby</i>

00:01:57.890 --> 00:02:00.830
<i>You can never hear it all</i>

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:03.430
<i>Because you have only one story</i>

00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:09.340
<i>Only this sky sees all at</i>
<i>once the sorrow and smiles</i>

00:02:09.340 --> 00:02:15.310
<i>That simultaneously fall in different</i>
<i>places around this wide world</i>

00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:21.820
<i>Will the sky one day grow tired of</i>
<i>looking down and lose its blue color?</i>

00:02:21.820 --> 00:02:27.660
<i>How can it stay unchanging after</i>
<i>watching innumerable dramas?</i>

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:33.930
<i>Even now everyone heads to his</i>
<i>own story without knowing a thing</i>

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:42.130
<i>There's just one blue sky over this</i>
<i>world rife with countless emotions</i>

00:02:42.870 --> 00:02:53.310
<i>Wordlessly marking out</i>
<i>time longer than anyone's...</i>

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:12.170
Lailalo, enter stealth mode.

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.160
Roger.

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.870
What is this?

00:03:29.990 --> 00:03:32.150
A marionette?

00:03:32.150 --> 00:03:33.350
Nakasugi!

00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:36.230
What is that?!

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:38.060
The Ryunka's assumed form.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:47.370
We'll drag it into the sea with the tractor beams!

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:48.360
Roger.

00:03:54.510 --> 00:03:56.500
Okay, keep pulling toward the sea!

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:10.420
Over there?

00:04:22.370 --> 00:04:24.610
15% charged.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:26.440
It will soon enter Vandeilo.

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:29.750
After we destroy the mature
Ryunka with the Astral Ergon,

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.280
we'll perform the purification.

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:34.620
47% of the planet's land will be obliterated...

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:35.990
There's no help for it.

00:04:35.990 --> 00:04:39.120
However, we can't carry out
the purification rites from here.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.550
I'll go.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.760
We'll let you act as guide.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:58.010
What's going on?

00:04:58.010 --> 00:04:59.240
This is...

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.080
We have hold of the Ryunka's assumed form.

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:04.010
We can only maintain fifteen sectors.

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.680
That's good enough.

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:06.950
Open up. I'm going out.

00:05:06.950 --> 00:05:07.940
Roger.

00:05:28.300 --> 00:05:30.500
<i>Wait for me, Tsutomu.</i>

00:05:38.710 --> 00:05:40.550
This is the place.

00:05:41.150 --> 00:05:52.490
Nakasugi!

00:06:01.570 --> 00:06:06.310
Nakasugi...

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:08.740
Sayaka!

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:13.020
Senkawa?

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:14.380
Tsutomu!

00:06:14.380 --> 00:06:16.020
Run away with me!

00:06:16.020 --> 00:06:17.650
Come on, hurry!

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:18.720
Sayaka!

00:06:18.720 --> 00:06:20.150
Tsutomu!

00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:30.370
Sayaka, let's run away.
You can't stay with Shyamalan.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:30.900
He's...

00:06:30.900 --> 00:06:33.600
That man is dead.

00:06:33.600 --> 00:06:36.170
I...

00:06:36.170 --> 00:06:38.000
...killed him.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:45.410
Sayaka?

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:49.220
Yes. I am Ryunka.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:54.290
This body's will put up quite a fight.
It wasn't easy to take possession.

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:58.760
But that man removed her power for me.

00:06:58.760 --> 00:07:05.230
The ones who awaken me always die by my hand.

00:07:05.230 --> 00:07:06.270
For some reason,

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:09.070
intelligent life forms wish for
others of their species to die.

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:12.240
Even though their brainpower is
supposed to be so highly evolved...

00:07:12.240 --> 00:07:14.380
Foolish life forms.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:17.750
I travel between these idiotic creatures

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.120
and erase all of them.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:24.650
Complete silence falling over this universe...

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:26.290
That is my wish.

00:07:26.290 --> 00:07:28.120
Give back Sayaka!

00:07:28.120 --> 00:07:31.960
I <i>am</i> Sayaka. And Ryunka.

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:37.230
Because you didn't stop
Sayaka from going to Shyamalan.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:38.300
Therefore...

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.100
That's not right! l...

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:44.770
Yes. When I awakened, we attacked that village.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:49.150
Mountains, trees, homes, humans...
Everything, indiscriminately.

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:52.080
That's not right! I...

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:58.450
Why? Why do all the people I love leave me?

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:01.990
Father, Mother, and Grandfather...

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:04.760
It was Shyamalan who killed Grandfather.

00:08:04.760 --> 00:08:05.960
And Yoshie...

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:08.760
I ate Yoshie.

00:08:08.760 --> 00:08:10.160
No!

00:08:12.030 --> 00:08:16.510
I've matured at last! Just a little longer...

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.870
Just a little longer,

00:08:18.870 --> 00:08:24.110
and I can consume all intelligent life in this world!

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:28.050
Hey, Tsutomu... Let's go to
the end of the world together.

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:30.150
This is the end of the world.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:33.060
After all, the world will end here.

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:38.490
Hey, Tsutomu... Together. Please!

00:08:38.490 --> 00:08:42.120
Please, stay with me, Tsutomu!

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:48.540
Of course, Sayaka. I won't
let you go anywhere anymore.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:52.530
From now on, I'll always be with you.

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:54.680
Tsutomu!

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:59.180
Birdy?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.660
Let me go, Birdy!

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:10.090
Tsutomu?! Please understand, Nakasugi is...

00:09:10.090 --> 00:09:13.760
I know! But she isn't gone yet!

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:14.830
Tsutomu?

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:17.600
She hasn't totally turned into the Ryunka yet!

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:19.870
I heard her voice!

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:21.170
You did?

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:25.170
I'm not lying. I might be able to save her!

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:26.840
How?

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.240
I'll...

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:36.750
The host has started resisting again.

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:40.220
Those two are nuisances.

00:09:40.220 --> 00:09:42.050
I'll erase them.

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:02.980
This is bad. It's maturing faster than I expected.

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.300
What's that?

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:43.350
What is that thing?

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:46.290
Stay back, Tsutomu. That's the Ryunka's true form.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.760
What? The Ryunka?

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:50.960
It's still developing.

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:55.460
When it's finished, it'll start killing humans.

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:59.640
It... It won't kill its host, right?

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:02.000
I don't think so. We might still have time.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:03.440
What?

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:06.210
We might be able to save Nakasugi.

00:11:06.210 --> 00:11:07.210
Birdy...

00:11:07.210 --> 00:11:10.950
This is our last chance. I won't give up.

00:11:10.950 --> 00:11:13.940
So don't you give up either, Tsutomu!

00:11:15.020 --> 00:11:31.870
Birdy!

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.210
Stop it!

00:12:28.260 --> 00:12:29.690
Sayaka?

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:33.450
Sayaka!

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:39.370
Sayaka. It's me!

00:12:39.370 --> 00:12:40.770
Sayaka!

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:56.650
Tsutomu?

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:58.620
Sayaka.

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:00.050
I...

00:13:04.760 --> 00:13:10.170
You again? Give up. This host belongs to me now.

00:13:10.170 --> 00:13:13.000
You're wrong. Sayaka hasn't disappeared yet.

00:13:13.000 --> 00:13:14.990
You're the one who's going to disappear!

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:24.010
Hey, do you remember?

00:13:32.520 --> 00:13:34.020
Yeah, I do.

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:35.850
I'm so glad!

00:13:38.630 --> 00:13:42.460
I want to stay with you forever, Tsutomu.

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:50.440
Tsutomu, watch with me as all the humans die.

00:13:50.440 --> 00:13:53.680
With me...

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:56.510
Okay, if you want to be with me.

00:14:03.020 --> 00:14:05.820
Tsutomu, no!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:08.360
Sayaka.

00:14:08.360 --> 00:14:13.360
Ryunka, I'll stay with you. So get out of Sayaka!

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:15.360
Tsutomu, stop!

00:14:15.360 --> 00:14:18.360
Come on, Ryunka. Come into my body!

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:49.860
Sayaka, it'll be okay now.

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:57.040
You idiot... You're such an idiot!

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:03.950
You were thinking the same thing, weren't you?

00:15:03.950 --> 00:15:07.920
You were gonna let the Ryunka infect you,
and kill yourself along with it.

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.020
You're an idiot.

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:13.260
I'm a Federation investigator! You're...

00:15:13.260 --> 00:15:15.690
I don't want you to die, Birdy.

00:15:15.690 --> 00:15:18.530
Tsutomu...

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:21.530
Or Sayaka either.

00:15:21.530 --> 00:15:24.100
So I'll...

00:15:24.100 --> 00:15:25.130
Tsutomu?!

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:30.710
Hurry, Birdy, before the Ryunka takes over!

00:15:30.710 --> 00:15:32.110
Hurry!

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:35.980
Birdy...

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:44.250
Tsutomu!

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:19.280
I've finished sealing away the Ryunka.

00:16:44.480 --> 00:16:45.880
Tsutomu...

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:54.360
Say.

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:56.860
I wonder if you'd give that to me?

00:16:56.860 --> 00:17:00.660
Since when can a soldier give orders to a pontiff?

00:17:00.660 --> 00:17:05.030
I'm only <i>asking.</i> It's not a bad deal for you.

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:09.000
We have conspirators in the Divine Council, too.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:10.340
In the Divine Council?

00:17:10.340 --> 00:17:12.170
That's how it is.

00:17:14.640 --> 00:17:16.350
Let's be smart here.

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:21.750
Sorry, but it was idiocy that let me seal this.

00:17:21.750 --> 00:17:23.550
I'll see you in court.

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:24.990
Hey, wait!

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:25.590
"Roppongi Area in Ruins"

00:17:25.590 --> 00:17:28.720
We don't yet know how many victims
the Roppongi disaster has claimed...

00:17:28.720 --> 00:17:32.160
There's a large low pressure system
standing still over Tokyo right now,

00:17:32.160 --> 00:17:32.560
"Special News Program"

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:35.430
and eyewitnesses report
large-scale lightning strikes...

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:40.040
It was a <i>huge</i> flash of light!
I mean, like <i>va-whoosh!</i> Right, Boss?

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:41.500
M-My car...

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:41.570
"Emergency Debate!! The Mystery
Behind the Roppongi Disappearances!?"

00:17:41.570 --> 00:17:45.570
I'm telling you, it was plasma! <i>P- l-a...</i>

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:45.700
"Emergency Debate!! The Mystery
Behind the Roppongi Disappearances!?"

00:17:48.080 --> 00:17:50.680
I hear Shyamalan is missing?

00:17:50.680 --> 00:17:56.050
Yes. He hasn't been found in the
area where <i>The Lost Bird</i> went down.

00:17:56.050 --> 00:18:01.890
I guess media opportunists leave
people talking both coming and going.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:03.930
The station's in turmoil.

00:18:03.930 --> 00:18:07.860
Especially the execs who followed Shyamalan.

00:18:07.860 --> 00:18:11.700
Like they say, "Pride goeth before a fall."

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:15.870
But all the working stiffs are in
a panic over Roppongi's collapse.

00:18:15.870 --> 00:18:19.240
Seems like they've all lost interest in Shyamalan.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:22.740
Man, you guys are so cold.

00:18:22.740 --> 00:18:27.420
Do <i>you</i> know something about what happened?

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:29.790
I'm not sure.

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.590
I'm not sure,

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:37.590
but Earth might've been on the
brink of its biggest disaster ever.

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:40.230
Again with the sensationalistic crap?

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:41.300
Well...

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.490
Sheesh!

00:18:53.010 --> 00:18:54.840
"Was It a Giant Meteor?"

00:18:54.840 --> 00:18:56.830
"The Lost Bird Sunk"
"Satyajit Shyamalan Missing"

00:18:58.310 --> 00:19:00.680
Come on, Nakasugi, don't cry!

00:19:00.680 --> 00:19:01.980
But!

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:05.950
You all made friends with me even
when I couldn't come to school much...

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:09.090
Don't forget us, okay Nakasugi?

00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:11.330
I won't! I promise to write letters!

00:19:11.330 --> 00:19:15.630
Sheesh, you two, it's not like
we can't ever see each other again.

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:21.170
She's right. Text us about
what your new school is like, okay?

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:23.770
The first day is key for a transfer student.

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:25.710
So don't be afraid! Go at 'em with fists flyin'!

00:19:25.710 --> 00:19:26.680
Ryo!

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:30.480
Nakasugi couldn't do that!
She's a sweet, quiet girl!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.280
And you're still getting well, too.

00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:35.450
Thank you, Hayamiya.

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:39.320
I won't forget any of you.
You're important friends of mine.

00:19:39.320 --> 00:19:40.620
Nakasugi!

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:42.660
Cheer up, Nakasugi.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:44.490
No more cryin'!

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:49.530
Senkawa!

00:19:49.530 --> 00:19:50.960
Uh-huh...

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:57.140
Take care, Nakasugi.

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:58.570
Thanks.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:20:02.140
I know we never really got the
chance to talk much, but you too.

00:20:02.140 --> 00:20:04.350
It's "Senkawa," right?

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:06.340
Yeah. Senkawa.

00:20:07.550 --> 00:20:09.520
Nakasugi's gone...

00:20:09.520 --> 00:20:11.690
Yeah. But it's for the best.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:14.860
You mean that she doesn't
remember most of the last three months?

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.530
Right.

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:20.530
It means she got to forget all of
the trouble after her grandpa died.

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:23.730
I did want you guys to get together, though...

00:20:27.270 --> 00:20:31.070
It's better this way.

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:34.510
Oh, please, stop acting like your life is over!

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:37.950
Cheer up! Everybody has to die alone.

00:20:37.950 --> 00:20:41.680
Plus, the person for you might
be closer nearby than you think!

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:44.080
See you! Hang in there!

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:50.960
Alone, huh?

00:20:50.960 --> 00:20:53.630
Nope, not exactly alone.

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:55.200
So true...

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:59.430
Hey, Birdy, how long will it take
to get my body back this time?

00:20:59.430 --> 00:21:03.100
You were really messed up,
so it might take a while.

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:08.480
I know I said to kill me, but you
could've pulled your punches a little!

00:21:08.480 --> 00:21:10.450
Hey! Birdy!

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:12.810
This feels good!

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:16.220
Sheesh, give me some warning!

00:21:16.220 --> 00:21:18.420
What if someone sees us?

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:21.390
It's fine. You're my buddy, right?

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:23.380
What does that have to do with it?

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:31.430
That's the Federation investigator
who sealed away the Ryunka?

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:35.140
Yes, Birdy Cephon Altira.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:38.570
She has a lot to learn,
but she's got sound instincts.

00:21:38.570 --> 00:21:41.970
I do believe she'll be interesting.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:43.810
<i>Let's go! Have a good time!</i>

00:21:43.810 --> 00:21:46.980
<i>A peaceful, happy</i>
<i>cheek-to-cheek time for everybody</i>

00:21:46.980 --> 00:21:52.980
<i>Put your hands, let's become one now</i>

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:01.260
<i>Come on, make some noise,</i>
<i>clap your hands, slap slap!</i>

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:03.330
<i>Lift your hands, clap your hands, slap slap!</i>

00:22:03.330 --> 00:22:05.430
<i>Everyone has their worries</i>

00:22:05.430 --> 00:22:07.700
<i>Given they're neverending,</i>
<i>what'll you do from here on out?</i>

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:11.610
<i>Live out the tight days</i>
<i>without getting upset about it</i>

00:22:11.610 --> 00:22:14.280
<i>Am I right, or am I right?</i>

